    "description" : "Ensures that all lines in the project use consistent line endings, either Windows (CRLF) or Unix (LF).",
    "explanation" : "This rule ensures your project uses only <tt>windows</tt> or\n<tt>unix</tt> line endings. This rule is disabled by default.",
