    "title" : "Disallow Trailing Semicolons",
    "description" : "This rule prohibits the use of unnecessary trailing semicolons at the end of lines in CoffeeScript code.",
    "explanation" : "This rule prohibits trailing semicolons, since they are needless\ncruft in CoffeeScript.\n<pre>\n<code># This semicolon is meaningful.\nx = '1234'; console.log(x)\n\n# This semicolon is redundant.\nalert('end of line');\n</code>\n</pre>\nTrailing semicolons are forbidden by default.",
